      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/RCMPNL/status/2004767545090273381",
      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY: Officers are currently responding to a tractor trailer blocking lanes of the Trans-Canada Highway near Whitbourne.\n\nMotorists should expect delays and are asked to drive with extreme caution and obey all directions from police.\n\nRoad conditions in the area ­— and across the province — are very poor. Please delay any non-essential travel. If you must travel, please exercise extreme caution and patience and drive according to road and weather conditions.",
